@startuml
title D-03 Cashier-Assisted Payment with Statutory Discount Validation Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Cashier
participant "Cashier-Assisted Terminal" as Terminal
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Central PMS /\nDiscount workflow" as Discount
participant "Payment Orchestrator /\nPayment Integration" as Pay
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate

Cashier -> Terminal : login and select assigned context
Cashier -> Terminal : scan / enter ticket or card number
Terminal -> Central : session lookup
Central -> Vendor : live session / tariff resolve
Vendor --> Central : session and payable basis
Central --> Terminal : payable basis
Cashier -> Terminal : initiate Senior/PWD validation
Terminal -> Discount : submit entitlement details,\nevidence, attestation
Discount --> Central : approved validation and payable effect
Central --> Terminal : refreshed payable basis
Cashier -> Terminal : collect payment
Terminal -> Pay : payment flow
Pay --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : fiscal document identity / status
Central -> Gate : issue ExitAuthorization if eligible
Central --> Terminal : payment, fiscal, and exit status

note over Terminal
Terminal captures and displays workflow state.
It does not approve entitlement,
mutate payable basis, declare finality,
or issue ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml
